msgid ""
"Enter a custom message to be displayed on the sleep screen. The following "
"escape sequences are available:\n"
"  %T title\n"
"  %A author(s)\n"
"  %S series\n"
"  %c current page number\n"
"  %t total page number\n"
"  %p percentage read\n"
